  _headline: "Rua agora \xE9 de todo mundo, n\xE3o s\xF3 do carro"
  _headlineEn: Streets now belong to everyone, not just cars
  _body: "Cal\xE7ada larga, travessia segura, ciclovia e faixa de \xF4nibus. Seu
    Arnaldo mede a rua nova com cara de quem perdeu espa\xE7o."
  _bodyEn: Wide sidewalks, safe crossings, bike lanes and bus lanes. Arnaldo measures
    the new street like a man who lost ground.
